   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## MiniMax H3 · keyframes along your camera\n\n**Guide Frames** carries the anchor along the Director's move, **Keyframes** picks one every 2 s on the H3 grid, **Fill Reveal (AI)** paints what the camera uncovers, and **H3 Guides** anchors them inside the generation (core `MiniMaxH3AddGuide`).\n\n- The anchor is also `<Picture 1>`; **Camera → Prompt** adds the move and the **look**.\n- **Switches**: Previz, Fill Reveal, Live Preview (TAEH3), Render, Upscale 2K.\n- Turbo LoRA: Ctrl+B, steps 4. Live preview needs KJNodes."
   ]
  },
